@page "/persistence"
<PageTitle>DockLayout Persistence</PageTitle>
<h1>Persistence</h1>
<p>The default adapter stores versioned XML in browser localStorage and keeps an in-memory fallback when storage is unavailable. Import rejects DTD/XXE, malformed XML and incompatible major versions without replacing current state.</p>
<pre>&lt;XLibDockLayout version=&quot;1.0.0&quot;&gt;...&lt;/XLibDockLayout&gt;</pre>
